      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Switched my theater back to SyncVideoPlayer just to make sure it's the SyncVideoStream component that's causing this and not something with my map, and everyone was able to load in just fine even after the video was 40+ minutes in without any kind of infinite loading screens or crashing, so it's definitely not my map, something is wrong with the SyncVideoStream component.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
