  "details": "Ever since switching my theater map over from VRC_SyncVideoPlayer to VRC_SyncVideoStream a lot of people have had trouble joining my map after a certain amount of time has passed in the video. Usually 20-30 minutes or more. I didn't have this problem myself for some reason, until I cleared my cache and now I've been getting it too randomly. It will load you in for about 3 seconds, and then send you into a loading screen, assumingly when the video fully loads.\n\nHere is my output log: https://pastebin.com/WXa1z6Rr",
